908261954943342", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303746_908261961610008_2600051788214719246_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PVjpoF6jN1oQ7kNvwFaZVPi&_nc_oc=AdrI1QlpMpoj4qe14HyFXHO2pDDL5GfvnZdNxFbM1ZpQugpnBAjX-WQqsnI1yR8pkek&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2Sl9m9LzA08aG2hgm20hSLiKUY_GWQc6I11k-Sm-X6TA&oe=69DBA2E2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cifraria", "keywords": ["Viol\u00e3o", "Ukulele", "Cifras", "Letras", "Biblioteca"], "long_description": "O **Cifraria** \u00e9 uma biblioteca profissional de m\u00fasicas e de gerenciamento de cifras desenvolvido em Flutter.\nCriado para m\u00fasicos de todos os n\u00edveis, oferece uma experi\u00eancia fluida para gerenciar, transpor e praticar suas m\u00fasicas favoritas, tanto no celular quanto no Quest.\n\n\u2728 **Funcionalidades**\n\n\ud83d\udcc2 **Arquitetura Inteligente**: Organize suas m\u00fasicas em pastas personalizadas com uma barra lateral em glassmorphism (efeito de vidro) para um visual premium e moderno.\n\n\ud83d\udcdc **Gest\u00e3o de Repert\u00f3rios**: Crie listas personalizadas e organize as m\u00fasicas na ordem exata da sua apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o.\n\n\ud83d\udcf2 **Compartilhamento Pro**: Exporte seus repert\u00f3rios atrav\u00e9s da extens\u00e3o exclusiva .cifraria via apps de mensagem ou utilize o QR Code para que outro dispositivo com o app recrie a lista e as m\u00fasicas automaticamente.\n\n\ud83d\udd04 **Transposi\u00e7\u00e3o Instant\u00e2nea**: Mude o tom das m\u00fasicas em tempo real com um motor de transposi\u00e7\u00e3o robusto.\n\n\u2601\ufe0f **Sincroniza\u00e7\u00e3o em Nuvem (Google Drive)**: Fa\u00e7a backup e restaure com seguran\u00e7a toda a sua biblioteca, incluindo pastas e m\u00fasicas favoritas.\n\n\ud83d\udcf1 **Pronto para o Meta Quest**: Modo paisagem otimizado e dimensionamento de interface para um ambiente de pr\u00e1tica imersivo e sem distra\u00e7\u00f5es no Meta Quest.\n\n\ud83d\udcc4 **Importa\u00e7\u00e3o Multiformato**: Importe cifras da web (extra\u00e7\u00e3o com apenas um clique) ou de arquivos locais (PDF e DOCX).\n\n\ud83c\udfb6 **Cifras Interativas**: Acordes clic\u00e1veis com gera\u00e7\u00e3o autom\u00e1tica de diagramas, com suporte para Viol\u00e3o e Ukulele.\n\n\u26a1 **Foco em Performance**: Banco de dados local para carregamento instant\u00e2neo e funcionamento 100% offline.", "short_description": "O Cifraria \u00e9 uma biblioteca profissional de m\u00fasicas e o seu aplicativo definitivo para gerenciar cifras."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "icon_app_cifraria_1440.png", "id": "25137093062632621", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_25137093065965954_5340243871155545084_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X2Yah6R1E8sQ7kNvwGoBed-&_nc_oc=AdouO-ucbM-3cVwcJEDrH0FY-VCm2JHMQK2_BvlFxlKu4w7Y6XUpUZCzUJQrOEBFJ8w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3TUL8f47RQN8P5bBwCRjNtDH91a6ck6L_ZB9n1D28Mvw&oe=69DBA924"}, {"file_name": "icon_app_cifraria_512.png", "id": "1950929249182186", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308090_1950929252515519_3579238828299289210_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w93q0fkuA48Q7kNvwHICPf7&_nc_oc=AdqEoN6HQ0NKmqiNFwv2sGKndJQbIfwkX8M1ZJd08Kel7D0aqfOcQ55AgUJrrra2RQo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2JdabeTyLjyZE9N7xh2J6gnA2srBrvVOR7M4dii1IKFw&oe=69DBABFC"}, {"file_name": "cover art cifraria.png", "id": "1221596580110880", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307422_1221596583444213_1996221161851683055_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TSdBzQHBTksQ7kNvwHL1qkT&_nc_oc=AdrnNb1PYO9bboHC5q26_JmEHnYbp1-u8eRY5ELr18Km-4SNOui4vPYnPK3jAg5SWzs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3Kid5_wxsUoBN58xZcDfyxcnAeXJN-NiNjZ8mLZ-zk6g&oe=69DB96EE"}, {"file_name": "hero cover cifraria.png", "id": "955328883720100", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_955328887053433_2299564742518944745_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k9Lg-8yXxtEQ7kNvwEA1mOf&_nc_oc=AdoaiqwDFs62c_2ljabg6spGUCS7INtEa8-JoBHng2DZxV2aWVFa9Eu52iiM1zGEeKQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2KBE4XgTN8Gpb6-tazxGiZpRjzJQ4LzHjYmFGGaQ-Wgg&oe=69DB9089"}, {"file_name": "cover_cifraria_portrait.png", "id": "923398230271609", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303790_923398233604942_8149238291275724655_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cqDaYLCN5vQQ7kNvwE0D5Yi&_nc_oc=AdrQfVK5luvtr0v2ntSroooo7UZ6x36_MEpEK-BpFCoCZ99Gtq5sqx465f65MXsoUzg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af173_DrcXN7Tg7PrryuZnQI1uVsBYRicVnNYqpyKuwkVw&oe=69DBA056"}]}, "id": "2120506675398089", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "home_10_Quest.png", "id": "1645036636740857", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819323_1645036640074190_2595786236772761378_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VvdTZ6ughZYQ7kNvwEaVkm-&_nc_oc=AdqtjSpwtJdCOJVxf9r_MGBwz_k-0TRCNxjShYadseRPBLWM46_oenmu_8h61kMVE74&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0rBM1S0tprZ7wKNCxxxcrTqyvJoo0cQMTDWwyXKyFV6g&oe=69DB8BF2"}, {"file_name": "settings_10_Quest.png", "id": "827413820421285", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820855_827413823754618_7016173846081243344_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MV6C8XjfmqQQ7kNvwEyEeqJ&_nc_oc=AdqIO7AzipEbFmgqzVBCl4W-WfLhGKxZrRTRwMMRAqou6ekTUmsXhkbsW7ng9LhnqNc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2ewvrOl6qYUWVb6wdbsXCv9Adigsf53Z7xcXQIb8pVmw&oe=69DB80A6"}, {"file_name": "home_10_settings_Quest.png", "id": "1684432329357395", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819854_1684432332690728_2661215708382739758_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UkmAPUuXF94Q7kNvwGeVMlK&_nc_oc=Adr979ifshgMPiVRXDQrQxghZC0jje4kvOV3tUivJsbmSPpzWT5PBLqJqfQy-b0fir8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3qU4bNKzsKm7hMgxtT0AELmA8_aRF4O07tXhZ__QUE7g&oe=69DB8463"}, {"file_name": "edit_10_Quest.png", "id": "991159246965883", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821682_991159253632549_3726168677936387175_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=USrpc37daPgQ7kNvwHofOHN&_nc_oc=AdrPeepgHk7xwUqwKvAkYceCJK0rwQZ0G2APJg4k_f1YkYkoo9h6hT5cbKfy04LaDvY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1mNbtS68N8T74wBZ4BPGxrUmXFTI8VEUabXj8j4LzxlA&oe=69DBA4A3"}, {"file_name": "player_10_Quest.png", "id": "966149539200528", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_966149542533861_6133643743596760205_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=13RTEv8eS_UQ7kNvwFuyaTY&_nc_oc=Adrv_FoW_XCZ05A89u5foCRXdlL-cGFeR_KtI2eXJSAuPI8Vaa7e93Fp4IySdFxFsZk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0QfhwiT2JOIXWxxsjR_agFyhzj2xyWqueAbAKiqVjVRw&oe=69DBA3F8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cifraria", "keywords": ["Guitar", "Chords", "Songbook", "Lyrics", "Ukulele"], "long_description": "**Cifraria** is a professional song library and guitar chord management application built with Flutter.\n\nDesigned for musicians of all levels, it offers a seamless experience for managing, transposing, and practicing your favorite songs across Mobile and Meta Quest devices.\n\n\u2728 **Features**\n\n\ud83d\udcc2 **Smart Library Architecture**: Organise your songs into custom folders with a glassmorphism sidebar for a premium feel.\n\n\ud83d\udcdc **Setlist Management**: Create custom lists and organize the songs in the exact order of your performance.\n\n\ud83d\udcf2 **Pro Sharing**: Export your setlists using the exclusive .cifraria extension via messaging apps or use the QR Code so that another device with the app can automatically recreate the list and songs.\n\n\ud83d\udd04 **Instant Transposition**: Change song keys on the fly with a robust transposition engine.\n\n\u2601\ufe0f **Cloud Sync (Google Drive)**: Securely backup and restore your entire library, including folders and favorite status.\n\n\ud83d\udcf1 **Meta Quest Ready**: Optimized landscape mode and UI scaling for a distraction-free practice environment in Meta Quest.\n\n\ud83d\udcc4 **Multi-format Import**:  Import songs from the web (one-click extraction) or local files (PDF & DOCX).\n\n\ud83c\udfb6 **Interactive Chord Charts**: Clickable chords with automatic diagram generation, supporting both Guitar and Ukulele.\n\n\u26a1 **Performance First**: Local database persistence for instant loading and 100% offline functionality.", "short_description": "Cifraria is a professional song library and guitar chord management application"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/18BVoWuGr5oKZaX6z0ZCklOlUod5mBmQH/view?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "David Kalil Braga", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://davidkalil10.github.io/Cifraria_Website/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "pt_BR"], 